&lt;p&gt;Yes (OIDC with GitHub)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Managed CSP Nonce Generation&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Yes (Edge Lambda injection)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;No (Manual config required)&lt;/p&gt;

